venv/
# Blanket rule, not a per-file list — the frontend got burned twice by
# listing exact filenames here (.env.local.example, then .env.production)
# and forgetting to add the next real .env* file before committing it.
.env*
!.env*.example
.DS_Store
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.idea/
/secrets/*
!/secrets/README.md

